{'symbol': 'DOV', 'date': '2021-05-07 16:19:00', 'title': 'DOVER DECLARES REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND', 'text': 'DOWNERS GROVE, ILL., MAY 7, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF DOVER (NYSE: DOV) TODAY DECLARED A REGULAR QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.495 (FORTY-NINE AND ONE-HALF CENTS) PER SHARE, PAYABLE ON JUNE 15, 2021, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF MAY 28, 2021.'}